148:개별 schema/path/operation/parameter/response/server fragment는 canonical identity를 갖고, 출력 OpenAPI component name은 target별 naming policy가 결정한다.\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:152:Canonical ID는 `@oa-sdk/parser`의 `parseDefinitionId()` / `validateDefinitionId()`가 검증하는 source identity다. 문법은 `kind:scope/domain/name`이며 `/`로 구분되는 path segment는 반드시 `scope`, `domain`, `name` 3개여야 한다. `schema:book/Note`, `schema:Note`, `schema:public/book/chapter/Note`는 invalid다.\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:156:- `domain`: `common`, `book`, `notebook`, `auth`, `user`, `health` 같은 bounded context. lower-case segment로 제한한다.\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:157:- `name`: domain-local definition name. component-like kind(`schema`, `response`, `parameter`, `requestBody`, `header`, `link`, `callback`, `securityScheme`)는 PascalCase를 요구한다.\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:159:Valid fixture IDs: `schema:public/book/Note`, `schema:public/notebook/Note`, `schema:shared/common/Error`. Duplicate canonical ID는 `validateDefinitionIds()`에서 error로 보고하며, output component name은 후속 naming policy가 target별로 파생한다.\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:163:`DefinitionNode`는 `@oa-sdk/parser`의 public primitive로, fragment source를 registry에 올리기 전 canonical identity와 diagnostics용 source metadata를 함께 운반한다. `createDefinitionNode()`는 canonical id를 `DefinitionId`로 파싱해 `kind`, `scope`, `domain`, `localName`을 채우고, `sourcePath`, `sourcePointer`, `contentHash`, `content`, optional `metadata`, `refs`를 그대로 보존한다.\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:165:`DefinitionRef`는 fragment content 안에서 발견한 source ref를 나타낸다. `createDefinitionRef()`는 raw `ref`, `sourcePath`, `sourcePointer`를 보존하고, target canonical id가 이미 알려진 경우 `targetId`로 저장한다. `metadata`는 target server, tags, feature flag, ownership 같은 classification 정보를 위한 optional field이며 canonical id 계층(`kind:scope/domain/name`)에는 포함하지 않는다. Output `$ref` rewrite는 후속 builder 단계가 담당한다.\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:169:`createDefinitionRegistry()`는 `DefinitionNode` 목록을 registry graph로 등록한다. `nodes`와 `nodeById`는 첫 번째 unique canonical id만 보존하고, 같은 canonical id가 다시 들어오면 `definition-registry/duplicate-id` error diagnostic을 만든다. Duplicate diagnostic은 중복 node의 `sourcePath`/`sourcePointer`와 최초 등록 node의 `firstSourcePath`/`firstSourcePointer`를 함께 담고, `lookupSourceLocation`이 제공되면 양쪽 line/column도 보강한다.\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:175:Canonical source ref syntax는 `oa://{kind}/{scope}/{domain}/{name}`이며, registry는 `oa://schema/shared/common/Error`를 canonical id `schema:shared/common/Error`로 정규화해 edge/ref의 `targetId`에 보존한다. 상대 file ref는 registered definition source와 일치할 때 canonical id로 정규화한다. 예를 들어 `/workspace/fragments/schema/public/book/Note.yaml#/content` 안의 `./Author.yaml#/content`는 같은 디렉터리의 `Author.yaml`에 등록된 node가 있으면 `schema:public/book/Author`로 해소된다. Pointer가 없는 상대 file ref는 해당 파일에 등록된 definition node가 하나일 때만 해소하고, 같은 파일에 여러 node가 있으면 explicit JSON Pointer가 필요하다.\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:177:Registry는 duplicate id 외에도 source ref diagnostic을 만든다. 유효한 canonical ref 또는 file ref가 등록된 target을 찾지 못하면 `definition-registry/missing-ref`, `oa://...` 문법이 canonical id로 정규화되지 않거나 legacy/internal/absolute ref처럼 builder source ref로 지원하지 않는 형식이면 `definition-registry/unsupported-ref`를 보고한다. Ref diagnostic은 raw `ref`, source path/pointer, optional line/column, file target path/pointer 또는 target canonical id를 보존한다. Output `$ref` rewrite는 다음 builder 단계의 책임이다.\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:181:`rewriteDefinitionOutputRefs()`는 registry의 resolved `targetId`와 node source pointer를 사용해 fragment `content`와 `refs` 안의 source `$ref`를 표준 OpenAPI component `$ref`로 변환한다. 기본 output name은 target node의 `localName`이며, target-local naming policy가 준비되면 `outputNames` map 또는 `resolveOutputName` callback으로 `schema:public/notebook/Note -> NotebookNote` 같은 alias를 주입한다.\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:183:Component-like kind의 output 위치는 고정 매핑이다: `schema -> #/components/schemas`, `response -> #/components/responses`, `parameter -> #/components/parameters`, `requestBody -> #/components/requestBodies`, `header -> #/components/headers`, `link -> #/components/links`, `callback -> #/components/callbacks`, `securityScheme -> #/components/securitySchemes`. 출력명 segment는 JSON Pointer escaping을 적용한다. Missing/unsupported source ref는 registry diagnostic을 그대로 보존하고 rewrite하지 않으므로 build emit 단계는 `valid` registry만 OpenAPI 문서로 내보내야 한다.\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:187:| Canonical identity | `kind:scope/domain/name` 고정 계층. 예: `schema:public/book/Note`, `schema:public/notebook/Note`, `schema:shared/common/Error`. source identity와 output component name을 분리 |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:189:| Source refs | `oa://schema/public/book/Note` 같은 canonical ref와 상대 file ref를 canonical id로 정규화 |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:190:| Output refs | registry `targetId`를 build target의 output name과 kind별 component 위치로 변환해 `#/components/schemas/{OutputName}` 같은 표준 OpenAPI ref로 rewrite |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:191:| Naming policy | `preserve-if-unique`, `domain-prefix`, explicit alias. `book.Note`와 `notebook.Note`는 source name을 바꾸지 않고 `BookNote`/`NotebookNote`처럼 출력명만 분리 |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:192:| Namespace scope | 이름 충돌 해결은 target server → domain → local name 순서로 처리. 같은 local name이라도 target bundle마다 포함 집합이 다르므로 output name allocation은 target-local이어야 함 |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:193:| Flattening guard | `schema:public/a/Name`과 `schema:public/aname/Name`은 flatten 결과가 같을 수 있어도 다른 canonical identity다. builder는 string flattening만으로 동치 추론을 하지 않고 `output-name-collision`으로 보고 |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:194:| Collision simulation | public/admin/internal target fixture에서 rename, `schema:public/a/Name` vs `schema:public/aname/Name` output collision, structural duplicate warning, duplicate canonical id error를 machine-readable report로 검증 |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:195:| Dedupe policy | duplicate canonical id는 error. 동일 구조 hash는 warning/info only. 의미가 다른 정의는 자동 structural dedupe 금지. deeper hierarchy는 canonical path가 아니라 metadata/tag로 표현 |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:196:| Target bundle | public/admin/internal 등 target별 servers, include domains, include paths, naming policy로 필요한 fragment와 transitive refs만 emit |\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:199:패키지 책임: `@oa-sdk/schemas`는 fragment layout/target config/fixtures/migration을 소유하고, `@oa-sdk/parser`는 validation/source/ref graph primitive를 제공하며, `@oa-sdk/codegen`은 `oa-gen build-spec` CLI와 WorkspaceIndex 연동을 소유한다.\\ndocs/internal/spec.md:223:oa-gen generate --drizzle-schema ./db/schema.ts --output ./domains/users/\\ndocs/guides/schema-algebra.md:139:- **RFC 6901 JSON Pointer 해석**: `#/components/schemas/User` 형식의 JSON Pointer를 해석하여 대상 스키마를 찾음\\ndocs/guides/schema-algebra.md:154:`typegen`은 ref graph를 사용해 외부 schema alias를 만들고 이름 충돌을 경고한다.\\ndocs/guides/schema-algebra.md:329:fold(#/components/schemas/Node)\\ndocs/guides/schema-algebra.md:330:  → stack: [\\\"#/components/schemas/Node\\\"]\\ndocs/guides/schema-algebra.md:331:  → properties.children.items → $ref: \\\"#/components/schemas/Node\\\"\\ndocs/guides/schema-algebra.md:343:  return { $ref: `#/components/schemas/${refName}` }  // 순환 탈출\\ndocs/guides/use-cases/codegen-workflow.md:9:## 1. Drizzle → OAS components.yaml\\ndocs/guides/use-cases/codegen-workflow.md:12:oa-gen generate --drizzle-schema ./src/db/schema.ts --output ./packages/schemas/src/domains/users/\\ndocs/guides/use-cases/codegen-workflow.md:24:  specPath: './packages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml',\\npackages/schemas/scripts/split-spec.ts:42:    file: '05-components-paths.md',\\ndocs/internal/plan.md:32:  ├─ securitySchemes, tags, webhooks, components\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:5:1. `packages/schemas/src/domains/{name}/spec.yaml` 생성\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:10:# domains/{name}/spec.yaml\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:12:  - name: my-domain\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:18:      tags: [my-domain]\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:27:                $ref: \\\"#/components/schemas/MyResource\\\"\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:29:components:\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:68:components:\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:90:              $ref: \\\"#/components/schemas/EventPayload\\\"\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:115:| `#/components/schemas/Error` | 표준 에러 응답 |\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:116:| `#/components/schemas/ValidationError` | 필드 검증 에러 |\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:117:| `#/components/responses/BadRequest` | 400 공통 응답 |\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:118:| `#/components/responses/Unauthorized` | 401 공통 응답 |\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:119:| `#/components/responses/Forbidden` | 403 공통 응답 |\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:120:| `#/components/responses/NotFound` | 404 공통 응답 |\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:121:| `#/components/responses/UnprocessableEntity` | 422 공통 응답 |\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:122:| `#/components/responses/InternalServerError` | 500 공통 응답 |\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:123:| `#/components/parameters/Page` | 페이지 번호 쿼리 파라미터 |\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:124:| `#/components/parameters/Limit` | 페이지 크기 쿼리 파라미터 |\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:125:| `#/components/securitySchemes/bearerAuth` | JWT Bearer 인증 |\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:126:| `#/components/securitySchemes/oauth2` | OAuth 2.0 인증 |\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:132:내부 참조는 `#/components/...` 형태를 기본으로 사용합니다. 누락된 내부 참조는 `oa-gen lint`와 `oa-gen validate`에서 `refs/valid-ref` 오류로 보고됩니다.\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:136:  $ref: \\\"#/components/schemas/User\\\"\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:145:  $ref: \\\"./shared.yaml#/components/schemas/User\\\"\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:156:  $ref: \\\"#/components/schemas/Uuid\\\"\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:170:# ./billing.yaml#/components/schemas/User → BillingUser\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:171:# ./identity.yaml#/components/schemas/User → IdentityUser\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:174:로컬 component와 외부 schema 이름이 충돌해도 외부 schema는 파일명 기반 타입명으로 생성됩니다.\\ndocs/guides/schema-authoring.md:178:도메인 병합 시 같은 `components.<section>.<name>`은 기본 오류입니다. 임시 호환이 필요한 경우에만 명시적으로 허용합니다.\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:16:        - $ref: '#/components/parameters/Page'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:17:        - $ref: '#/components/parameters/Limit'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:36:                      $ref: '#/components/schemas/User'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:52:          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:66:              $ref: '#/components/schemas/CreateUserRequest'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:80:                $ref: '#/components/schemas/User'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:90:          $ref: '#/components/responses/BadRequest'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:92:          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:94:          $ref: '#/components/responses/UnprocessableEntity'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:96:          $ref: '#/components/responses/InternalServerError'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:125:                $ref: '#/components/schemas/User'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:135:          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:137:          $ref: '#/components/responses/NotFound'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:151:              $ref: '#/components/schemas/UpdateUserRequest'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:163:                $ref: '#/components/schemas/User'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:173:          $ref: '#/components/responses/BadRequest'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:175:          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:177:          $ref: '#/components/responses/Forbidden'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:179:          $ref: '#/components/responses/NotFound'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:181:          $ref: '#/components/responses/UnprocessableEntity'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:194:          $ref: '#/components/responses/Unauthorized'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:196:          $ref: '#/components/responses/NotFound'\\npackages/schemas/src/domains/users/spec.yaml:198:components:\\npackages/client/src/__tests__/generate-client.test.ts:14:      target: ScriptTarget.ES2022,\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/44fae87f_2026-04-15_12-18-21_US-012.log:6:- **Task Title**: Implement deterministic aliases for supported non-component refs\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/44fae87f_2026-04-15_12-18-21_US-012.log:7:- **Description**: As an OA SDK maintainer, I want supported external non-component refs to receive stable TypeScript names so that typegen output remains deterministic.\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/44fae87f_2026-04-15_12-18-21_US-012.log:28:US-011 already broadened discovery to schema-position `$defs` and custom roots, so I’m going to inspect the current alias allocator and tests to find the remaining deterministic naming gap for US-012.\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/44fae87f_2026-04-15_12-18-21_US-012.log:31:\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\"rg -n \\\\\\\"US-007|US-011|external alias|alias policy|unsupported|\\\\\\\\\\\"'$defs|non-components...\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/44fae87f_2026-04-15_12-18-21_US-012.log:45:I found the likely gap: current external alias naming only reserves local schema names, while `generateTypes()` also emits operation types such as `ListFooResponse` and `ListFooOp`. US-012 requires external aliases to avoid those names too, so the allocator needs the same operation-name awareness and diagnostics for unsupported pointer cases.\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/44fae87f_2026-04-15_12-18-21_US-012.log:53:I’m going to patch `generate-types.ts` so external alias assignment reserves operation-generated type names, emits a specific warning when an alias is renamed for that reason, and classifies unsupported external pointer targets before alias creation.\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/44fae87f_2026-04-15_12-18-21_US-012.log:57:The tests now lock two US-012 cases: an external alias named like an operation bundle gets file-stem renamed, and a schema-position ref into `components.responses` becomes an explicit warning plus `unknown` instead of an accidental alias. Next I’m running focused typecheck to catch typing issues in the patch.\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/44fae87f_2026-04-15_12-18-21_US-012.log:59:Codegen typecheck is clean. I’m running the typegen test file next, since that exercises the alias allocator directly before I update docs counts.\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/44fae87f_2026-04-15_12-18-21_US-012.log:64:I’m updating the internal docs now because this adds two typegen diagnostics/tests and changes the documented alias policy slightly: external aliases also reserve operation type names, and unsupported external pointer roots degrade to `unknown` with a warning.\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/44fae87f_2026-04-15_12-18-21_US-012.log:108:I noticed one edge while reviewing the operation-name reservation helper: `generateTypes()` can emit `XxxResponse` and `XxxResponseHeaders` from `default` when there is no 2xx response. I’m tightening the helper to mirror that so alias reservation stays exact.\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/44fae87f_2026-04-15_12-18-21_US-012.log:122:Changed [generate-types.ts](/Users/junwoobang/workflow/oa-sdk/packages/codegen/src/typegen/generate-types.ts) so external `$defs` and supported non-component schema aliases now reserve local schema names and generated operation type names before allocation. Operation-name collisions reuse the existing file-stem deterministic rename path and emit `external-schema-shadows-operation` diagnostics. Unsupported schema-position refs into non-schema OAS roots now emit `external-schema-unsupported-pointer` and fall back to `unknown` so generated TypeScript does not contain dangling aliases.\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/44fae87f_2026-04-15_11-37-28_US-008.log:7:- **Description**: As an OA SDK maintainer, I want a SQLi