ons/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:21:I’ll first read the repo guidance and existing progress notes, then trace the resolver/typegen paths before making any tests or docs changes.\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:23:\\\\\\\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\\\\\\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"rg -n \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"resolveRefGraph|derefSpec|typegen|external ref|external refs|\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"'$ref\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" . -g '\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"...\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:25:The initial search shows the parser already has deref and ref graph coverage, while codegen’s `generate-types.ts` is the typegen path that calls both `resolveRefGraph()` and `derefSpec()`. I’m pulling the repo instructions and existing progress file next, including hidden paths.\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:33:\\\\\\\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\\\\\\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"sed -n '1,280p' packages/parser/src/ref-graph.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:34:\\\\\\\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\\\\\\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"sed -n '1,380p' packages/parser/src/deref.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:36:\\\\\\\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\\\\\\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"sed -n '1,380p' packages/parser/src/__tests__/ref-graph.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:37:\\\\\\\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\\\\\\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"sed -n '1,420p' packages/parser/src/__tests__/deref.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:43:\\\\\\\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\\\\\\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"rg -n \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"externalSpecPath|nestedExternalSpecPath|collisionSpecPath|\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\