l-workspace-index.md:113:create index refs_from_file_idx on refs(from_file);\\\\\\\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:115:create index diagnostics_file_idx on diagnostics(file_path);\\\\\\\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:121:   - entry spec, domain specs, profile specs, external ref 후보 파일을 수집한다.\\\\\\\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:126:   - cache key에는 `oa-sdk` version, index schema version, resolver options, profile, override config, typegen options를 포함한다.\\\\\\\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:129:   - changed/deleted file의 `components`, `refs`, `diagnostics`, `source_locations`, `type_aliases`를 삭제한다.\\\\\\\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:130:   - `refs.to_file` 역방향 query로 영향을 받는 source file을 dirty 처리한다.\\\\\\\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:133:   - YAML/JSON parse, source map 생성, component 수집, `$ref` edge 수집을 다시 수행한다.\\\\\\\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:138:   - ref cycle은 DB edge를 읽어 메모리 graph DFS/Tarjan으로 판정한다.\\\\\\\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:139:   - missing external ref는 resolver diagnostic으로 기록한다.\\\\\\\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:142:   - validate는 dirty/impacted 파일 diagnostic을 갱신한다.\\\\\\\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:143:   - typegen은 external alias/type output 영향이 있을 때 재생성한다.\\\\\\\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:198:2. `resolveRefGraph()`를 resolver 기반으로 이전.\\\\\\\\ndocs/internal/architecture/006-incremental-workspace-index.md:199:3. `derefSpec()`를 resolver 기반으로 이전.\\\\\\\\ndocs/internal/goals/goal-1-schemas.md:46:| Redocly | $ref 해석 + 스펙 구조 검증 |\\\\\\\\npackages/mock-server/src/errors/types.ts:17:  // Mock 서버가 요청 검증용 JSON Schema를 컴파일할 수 없음\\\\\\\\npackages/mock-server/src/errors/types.ts:28:  /** JSONPath 형식 필드 경로 (e.g. \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/body/email\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") */\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:6:- **Task Title**: Audit resolver paths and lock baseline behavior\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:7:- **Description**: As an OA SDK maintainer, I want the current resolver behavior mapped and protected by baseline tests so that later refactors do not silently change external ref, sibling, or cycle semantics.\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:21:I’ll first read the repo guidance and existing progress notes, then trace the resolver/typegen paths before making any tests or docs changes.\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:23:\\\\\\\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\\\\\\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"rg -n \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"resolveRefGraph|derefSpec|typegen|external ref|external refs|\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"'$ref\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" . -g '\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"...\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:25:The initial search shows the parser already has deref and ref graph coverage, while codegen’s `generate-types.ts` is the typegen path that calls both `resolveRefGraph()` and `derefSpec()`. I’m pulling the repo instructions and existing progress file next, including hidden paths.\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:33:\\\\\\\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\\\\\\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"sed -n '1,280p' packages/parser/src/ref-graph.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:34:\\\\\\\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\\\\\\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"sed -n '1,380p' packages/parser/src/deref.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:36:\\\\\\\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\\\\\\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"sed -n '1,380p' packages/parser/src/__tests__/ref-graph.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:37:\\\\\\\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\\\\\\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"sed -n '1,420p' packages/parser/src/__tests__/deref.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:43:\\\\\\\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\\\\\\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"rg -n \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"externalSpecPath|nestedExternalSpecPath|collisionSpecPath|\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.yaml#/components/...\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:45:The implementation split is clear: parser `resolveRefGraph()` has its own traversal/cache, parser `derefSpec()` uses `DerefFolder` plus the ref graph pointer helper, and codegen `generateTypesFromSpec()` calls `analyzeExternalSchemaRefs()` which uses the ref graph and falls back to `derefSpec()` for external schemas. I’m going to add focused baseline tests around those exact boundaries and document the current gaps without changing runtime behavior. \\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:47:I’m making scoped changes now: a parser baseline file for graph and deref semantics, codegen typegen tests for external alias behavior, and internal docs that record the current path split and known resolver gaps.\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:49:\\\\\\\\u{1b}[94m[shell]\\\\\\\\u{1b}[0m $ /bin/zsh -lc 'pnpm --filter @oa-sdk/parser test packages/parser/src/__tests__/resolver-baseline.test...\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:65:> vitest run \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"packages/parser/src/__tests__/resolver-baseline.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:70:filter:  packages/parser/src/__tests__/resolver-baseline.test.ts\\\\\\\\n.ralph-tui/iterations/e8849d83_2026-04-15_10-32-54_US-001.log:74:\\\\\\\\u{1b}[94m[shel